/* AAC-LD / AAC-ELD decoder (sauti_aac_er.c): AudioSpecificConfig, frame decoding against recorded fingerprints, atomicity on bad input, mutated and truncated access units, the AAC-LD
 * window / overlap arithmetic against an independent direct implementation.
 *
 * The access units below are the first frames of the fixtures tests/data/{ld,eld}_{st,mono}.m4a (fdkaac -p 23 / -p 39; make_fixtures.sh).  The fingerprints of their decoded PCM
 * (sum, sum of squares, position-weighted sum and the energy of the second difference, i.e. of the high frequencies, per frame and channel) were recorded from the decoder after it matched FFmpeg to ~139 dB on the whole fixtures
 * (scripts/test_aac_er_vs_ffmpeg.sh), so a change of the filterbank, the window, the overlap or the syntax changes them.  Random bit flips and every truncation length must give a clean
 * error with the state and the output untouched. */
